# The one build output directory, and deliberately the only `dist/`
# ignored: `uv build` run from the repository root instead of against
# the crate drops artifacts in a root `dist/`, and leaving that path
# untracked-and-visible is what makes the mistake show up.
crates/remanence-py/dist/
